// What the old world left behind. Pulled out of drowned ruins by a
// salvage rig while the tower is stopped, and spent at an enclave —
// scrap is the only material in the pack the chain cannot make, and the
// only one that arrives by standing still.
//
// Its single consumer is the enclave's exchange board (`SYSTEMS.md`
// §3.5), which you pass once. Scrap taken late in region 2 banks
// against M5's sun-forge; that tail is a recorded exception rather than
// an oversight (`SYSTEMS.md` §3.10, "Deferred out of M3").
#![enable(implicit_some)]
ItemDef(
    id: "item.scrap",
    name: "Scrap",
    glyph: "⚙️",
    order: 40,
)
